<title>USA: Somatix says cancer vaccine data positive.</title>
<headline>Somatix says cancer vaccine data positive.</headline>
<dateline>ALAMEDA, Calif 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Somatix Therapy Corp said multiple dose Phase I/II trials of GVAX cancer vaccine in about 50 patients with advanced melanoma showed positive results.</p>
<p>The data demonstrate clinical safety and evidence of a specific cellular immune response directed at the tumor at multiple sites of disease. Partial tumor regression was also seen in some patients, although definite conclusions regarding anti-tumor efficacy will require more trials, it said.</p>
<p>Additional trials of GVAX cancer vaccine are planned after the pending merger between Somatix and Cell Genesys Inc.</p>
</text>
